This product includes software adapted from NousResearch/hermes-agent
(https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent), licensed under the MIT License.
The following modules adapt design patterns and portions of implementation from
that project. Each adapted file includes a header comment naming the original
Hermes source file.

- runtime/ts_harness/tools/registry.py — tool registry, generation counter, TTL cache
- runtime/ts_harness/tools/toolsets.py — declarative toolset composition
- runtime/ts_harness/tools/delegation.py — subagent delegation guardrails
- runtime/ts_harness/tools/mcp_client.py — MCP client lifecycle and circuit breaker
- runtime/ts_harness/tools/approvals.py — command approval guards
- runtime/ts_harness/tools/file_tools.py — path safety and workspace discipline
- runtime/ts_harness/sandbox/docker_env.py — Docker execution environment
- runtime/ts_harness/skills/guard.py — skill security scanner
- runtime/ts_harness/skills/threat_patterns.py — shared threat regex patterns

